invalid type: string "==================================================\n\n--- Page 1 ---\n[WANT TO GET ALL SUBJECT NOTES: WWW.FREEILM.COM] [WEBSITE: WWW.FREEILM.COM]\n\nUnit 9: Human Digestive System\n\nShort Questions\n\nSHORT ANSWER QUESTIONS EXERCISE\n\nQ1. What is the main function of the\ndigestive system?\nAns. Function of digestive system is to\nbreak down food into smaller and\nuctose.\n